WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Alex Rep: Thanks for joining again, Dana and Priya. Last time we covered the rollout plan for your three warehouses.

2
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Dana Lopez: Yes. Honestly the pilot looks good to me. My main concern is that the Salesforce sync has to be live before we can sign anything.

3
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Priya Shah: From the IT side we need a security review. Our team can finish that review by October 20th if you send the SOC 2 report this week.

4
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Alex Rep: Understood. I will send the SOC 2 report by Friday and book a technical call with your integration team.

5
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:58.000
Dana Lopez: Great. I have budget approved for this quarter, so if the security review passes we want to sign before the end of November.

6
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:10.000
Priya Shah: One thing, the pricing for extra warehouses seems high compared to what we budgeted. Can you look at that?

7
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:20.000
Alex Rep: I will check with finance on volume discounts and get back to you next week.
